<title>FRANCE: EU agrees Italian food aid to Mauritania.</title>
<headline>EU agrees Italian food aid to Mauritania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has agreed the supply of Italian rice worth 150 million lire and of Italian soft wheat worth 350 million lire to Mauritania as food aid, EU grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates were not specified.</p>
<p>The EU's grain management committee took the decision at its weekly meeting on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
